  "behavior_and_ownership": [
    "Exact resolved or immutable view identity/revision/full-entry and text hashes bind Unicode-codepoint continuation; current source/cause disclosure remains mandatory for immutable history.",
    "Native SQLite snapshot chooses real fixed highwater and truthful prefix/exhaustion; filtered empty pages advance. Byte-capped prefixes leave cursor before an unreturned authorized entry; unsplittable metadata refuses.",
    "Flat deterministic scope token binds native task/objective/session/thread/epoch, full provider.info and final accumulated disclosure floor; it grants no authority. Exact accepted adapter is checked across awaits; owner default changes do not repin accepted tasks.",
    "Agent-only raw scan API, bounded owned streaming client, fixed input-free refusals, no-store responses, no private capability forwarding, no redirect/compression/retry. Cancellation/deadline never proves actual cleanup; retained owners and sticky close uncertainty remain.",
    "Final guarded shared closure includes old and prospective roots after earlier view/task/session reads. Raw/resolved views are checked, inconsistent legacy duplicates refuse, and roots are not adopted before checks. This is an asynchronous observation, not atomic publication across external changes.",
    "Actual native export admission still checks current source/session/disclosure before count/generation, including retained roots after prompt eviction. Retrieved transcript adds no instruction source, objective authority or side-effect grant.",
    "Legacy short lists retain prior fields; clipped entries label view/truncation/total length and paging hint. Aggregate omission refuses rather than silently ending history."
  ],
